#heading(level: 1, "RUNIC ITEMS")
#para(((emph: "", text: "Runic items are effectively magic items tailored to your own requirements by combining abilities. A Dwarf character can carry runic items, and the total points values of those runic items is limited as mentioned in the army list."),))
#para(((emph: "", text: "It is important to remember that a runic item is no different from a magic item, and all the usual rules for magic items still apply. All the rules that apply to the possession and use of magic items also apply to runic items."),))

#entry("CREATING A RUNIC ITEM")
#para(((emph: "", text: "Unless otherwise noted, runes can be inscribed onto the following things: weapons, armour, talismans, standards, and war machines. Each of these has its own types of runes."),))
#para(((emph: "", text: "If a model is permitted to take a Magic Weapon, they may choose Weapon Runes and apply them to their hand weapon."),))
